# For LOCAL testing only: copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in real values.
# `wrangler dev` reads .dev.vars automatically -- it is NOT committed to git.
#
# For PRODUCTION, these same values go in the Cloudflare dashboard instead:
# Workers & Pages -> voice-agent-beta -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets
# (add each as a "Secret", not a plain text "Variable", since these are
# credentials).

